      "worked": "Direct dependence on $V$ and inverse dependence on $R$ combine to give the model below. Using the given values,\n$$\\begin{align*}I&=\\frac{kV}{R}\\\\5&=\\frac{20k}{4}\\\\k&=1\\end{align*}$$\nWhen $V=30$ and $R=5$,\n$$\\begin{align*}I&=\\frac{30}{5}\\\\I&=6\\end{align*}$$",
